error[L0213]: `{1}` names no type parameter
 --> expand/rust_type_errors.rslisp:1:34
  |
1 | (rust-type shifted (where (item) "Box<{1}>"))
  |                                  ^^^^^^^^^^ this type has 1 type parameter
  |
  = help: declare the type parameters in a `where`, as in `(where (item) "Vec<{0}>")`

